    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d283">

                <pb facs="0461" n="357" xml:id="pg357"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 837.13/6.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                            American Minister.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-03-05T18:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 5, 1913—6 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>This Government trusts that the President of Cuba pursuant to his declarations
                    reported by you in your No. 585 of January 9, 1913, will take action to restrict
                    the amnesty to political offenders.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bryan</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
